      "placement": "traits",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "When the shimmer seal is on an icy surface or underwater, it is invisible. In all other terrain, the shimmer seal has advantage on Dexterity (Stealth) checks. Seals, other pinnipeds, and creatures chosen by the shimmer seal can see it."
      ]
